A wand of polymorph may also help... Take everything you deem valuable in the
shop, and then zap the shopkeeper with the wand.  There is a good chance that
he will become something easy to overpower -- You end up killing a gnome and
getting over 1000 gold.  There is a risk, of course -- but if the storekeeper
becomes something nasty, zap him again.  (It's not very ethical; but neither 
is carrying a dead leprechaun into a store and eating him, I suppose...)


